  "full_name": "cool-japan/tensorlogic",
  "description": "TensorLogic compiles logical rules (predicates, quantifiers, implications) into tensor equations (einsum graphs) with a minimal DSL + IR, enabling neural/symbolic/probabilistic models within a unified tensor computation framework.",
